              <div class="res-desc">Covers 16 system designs with interactive diagrams: DNS, CDN, sequencer, distributed search, YouTube, Quora, Google Docs, pub/sub, rate limiter, blob store, distributed task scheduler, Yelp, Google Maps, Uber, Twitter, and Newsfeed. Each design has: requirements, high-level design, detailed design, evaluation. The interactive format lets you explore each component.</div>
