              <div class="res-name"><a href="https://madewithml.com/" target="_blank" class="res-link">Made With ML -- MLOps Course (free) <span class="res-link-arrow">&nearr;</span></a></div>
              <div class="res-desc">Free at madewithml.com. Covers the MLOps lifecycle end-to-end: product design, data engineering (labeling, preprocessing, augmentation), model training (baselines, experiment tracking, hyperparameter optimization), evaluation (offline metrics, behavioral testing, online metrics), serving (REST, batch, streaming), and monitoring (performance, drift). Every concept includes working Python code. The best free MLOps resource.</div>
              <div class="res-tags"><span class="rtag free">Free</span><span class="rtag tool">MLOps</span></div>
            </div>
