        <div class="insight"><b>The observability triad:</b> Logs (what happened -- structured JSON logs with correlation IDs), Metrics (how much/how fast -- Prometheus + Grafana for dashboards), Traces (the journey of a request across services -- OpenTelemetry + Jaeger). Every production system must have all three. Set them up before you need them, not during an incident. Free stack: Grafana Cloud free tier (logs + metrics + traces) or self-hosted Prometheus + Loki + Tempo + Grafana.</div>
