        <div class="do-box"><b>The complete SE checklist for every project:</b> (1) Requirements document (even if just for yourself). (2) Design doc with architecture diagram. (3) Git with meaningful commit messages. (4) Tests (unit + integration minimum). (5) CI pipeline (GitHub Actions). (6) Containerized deployment (Docker). (7) Monitoring (at least health check + error alerting). (8) README with setup instructions, architecture overview, and API docs. (9) Postmortem for any incident. Treat personal projects with this discipline and professional projects become natural.</div>
